Letta MemFS is the git-backed memory filesystem documented and implemented by
Letta (https://github.com/letta-ai/letta-code, Apache License 2.0). SSIOS
does not vendor that source. The local mode labeled letta-memfs-compat follows
the public file layout: root Markdown is core memory, nested MEMORY.md
directories are loaded on demand, and approved edits are git commits.

The npm package named "memfs" is a different in-memory filesystem and is not
used here.
